">required</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span>\n      <span class=\"token literal-property property\">nodeSelectorTerms</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token operator\">-</span> matchExpressions<span class=\"token operator\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token operator\">-</span> key<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> kubernetes<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>io<span class=\"token operator\">/</span>hostname\n              <span class=\"token literal-property property\">operator</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> In\n              <span class=\"token literal-property property\">values</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span>\n              <span class=\"token comment\">// 指定了k8s服务器</span>\n                <span class=\"token operator\">-</span> centos<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>k8s<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>server2\n<span class=\"token operator\">--</span><span class=\"token operator\">-</span>\n<span class=\"token literal-property property\">apiVersion</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> v1\n<span class=\"token literal-property property\">kind</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> PersistentVolumeClaim\n<span class=\"token literal-property property\">metadata</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token literal-property property\">name</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> beszel<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>data\n  <span class=\"token literal-property property\">namespace</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> beszel\n<span class=\"token literal-property property\">spec</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token literal-property property\">accessModes</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token operator\">-</span> ReadWriteOnce\n  <span class=\"token literal-property property\">storageClassName</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> beszel<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>local\n  <span class=\"token literal-property property\">resources</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token literal-property property\">requests</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span>\n      <span class=\"token literal-property property\">storage</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> 30Gi<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre>\n\n<h3 id=\"服务端部署-02-beszel-yaml\"><a href=\"#服务端部署-02-beszel-yaml\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"服务端部署 02-beszel.yaml\"></a>服务端部署 02-beszel.yaml</h3><pre class=\"line-numbers language-javascript\" data-language=\"javascript\"><code class=\"language-javascript\"><span class=\"token literal-property property\">apiVersion</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> apps<span class=\"token operator\">/</span>v1\n<span class=\"token literal-property property\">kind</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> Deployment\n<span class=\"token literal-property property\">metadata</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token literal-property property\">name</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> beszel\n  <span class=\"token literal-property property\">namespace</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> beszel\n<span class=\"token literal-property property